description=Run Linux containers on Android via a privileged daemon that bypasses the app seccomp filter. Docker Hub pull, private-namespace mounts (host audio stays intact), PTY shells. v0.1.1: atomic watchdog lock (no duplicate daemons), socket-fallback client, symlink-safe list.
